aspect_ratio"}, {"widget": {"name": "megapixels"}, "name": "megapixels", "label": "megapixels", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "megapixels"}, {"widget": {"name": "multiple"}, "name": "multiple", "label": "multiple", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "multiple"}], "flags": {}, "id": 115, "type": "ResolutionSelector", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ResolutionSelector"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "positive", "links": [238], "label": "positive", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "positive"}, {"name": "LATENT", "links": [236], "label": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "LATENT"}], "size": [430, 550], "pos": [-470.57635498046875, 4006.16748046875], "widgets_values": ["For the target video, at 0.00 seconds into the target video, <Picture 0> (from [Shot 1]) is fully referenced.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] In a single continuous take rendered in a photorealistic cinematic wuxia style with warm golden-hour backlight and soft atmospheric haze, the frame opens exactly on the reference composition: on a cliff edge above a vast sea of clouds at sunset, a wuxia swordswoman in flowing white robes holds a low stance, her jian extended forward with the blade catching the light, left arm raised high, long black hair and sash whipping in the wind, an orange sword-qi trail curling through the air and dust swirling at her feet, while dark pines and sheer cliffs frame the sinking sun. She immediately pivots on her front foot and sweeps the sword in a wide horizontal circle, the blade dragging a glowing ribbon of orange qi that lingers in the air as dust and grit burst outward. Without pause, she flows into a spinning leap, robes and sash flaring wide, the blade carving a second overhead arc of qi while glowing sparks scatter. The camera holds a low-angle full shot and arcs subtly around her with small amplitude at slow speed, keeping her centered throughout the action. At the 00:03.500 mark, time ramps into slow motion as she lands and snaps into a final lunge — sword thrust straight forward with a bright flare of qi, left hand snapped back into sword-fingers, robes and sash suspended mid-wave; the camera pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed, tightening to a medium view of her fierce eyes and the thrust blade catching the sunset light. In the last second, normal speed resumes as residual qi sparks drift away and her hair settles, she holding the heroic pose against the golden sky, with no on-screen text and no black frames throughout.\noverall_soundscape: Wind howls across the cliff edge, and each sword sweep releases a sharp whoosh with a resonant metallic ring, followed by a swirling shimmering tone trailing the orange qi ribbon. A deep bass thump with a muffled slow-motion drop lands on the final thrust, ending in lingering wind and a single distant bell tone.\nnon_diegetic_music: Expansive epic strings with a touch of erhu swell in dynamics and rise in tempo as she snaps into the final thrust, then thin out to a sustained quiet pad beneath the closing bell tone.", 1344, 768, 73], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 241, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 242, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "first_frame", "link": 244, "label": "first_frame", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "first_frame"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "last_frame", "label": "last_frame", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "last_frame"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "link": 246, "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "link": 247, "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}, {"widget": {"name": "length"}, "name": "length", "link": 245, "label": "length", "type": "INT", "lo